Package: nerdshell-desktop
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Nerdshell Project
Depends: zsh, libgtk-3-0, libvte-2.91-0, openssh-client
Recommends: starship, eza, bat, btop, fastfetch, fzf, fd-find, ripgrep, zoxide, zsh-autosuggestions, zsh-syntax-highlighting, fonts-jetbrains-mono
Conflicts: nerdshell-desktop-beta
Description: Native Nerdshell terminal for Debian and Ubuntu
 Nerdshell Desktop is a GTK/VTE terminal emulator with tabs, local PTY
 sessions, OpenSSH compatibility and an isolated Nerdshell Zsh profile.
